    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></munderover><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math></p><p>Let <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></munderover><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mro